C03: the visible-defect clock check gets the countdown exemption too (CLOCK1333)

CLOCK1331 measured: the countdown exemption reached _payload_fact_defect only; compose_visible_defect keeps its own clock check and vetoed «Faltan 13 horas y 48 minutos para las 3 de la tarde.» eighteen times as missing_name. That check now treats a countdown request the same way: the observed clock is optional in the final, and the asked time and the remaining hours and minutes are not contrary clock claims.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


